                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "UI scale poorly, cannot use windows mode because ui elements is outside the screen\n\nA lot of graphical bugs in game\n\nSlow moving camera in a game where time is important\n\nSometimes you cannot do anything for long periods of time thanks to how the game laws are designed\n\nCannot place multiple buildings at once, need to go back to the buildings menu for every building\n\nSimply poor camera controls\n\nPoor introduction to the game, you lose without understanding what happened or why you couldn't do anything.\n\nResolution keeps resetting back to 640x480\n\nYou get an indication that you can build but you can still not build because of some other factor that is shown with a small icon that you barely can see.\n\nWhen you break a law you just silently loose time. If I keep doing the same mistake as I try to learn the game, there is not enough feedback on how severe the mistake is.\n\nShould be a restart level button in the esc menu\n\nSeveral more bugs and annoyances discovered in just over 30 minutes of game time. The dev should know better than to release this before the game is more polished and tested.\n",
